10/19/2026

The file `encircled_energy_SLOAN_SDSSrprime_filter_AgMirrors.csv` contains the fraction of encircled energy (EE) for the SDSS r filter as a function of aperture size (r) and the telescope jitter (jitter). The data has been generated by simulating full PSFs and calculating the encircled energy for a given value of jitter and aperture size. The ETC takes this as a baseline and generates the Encircled energy for a given aperture and jitter by interpolating the curves here. Currently, the ETC assumes an IMX sensor and r band filter. Future updates will consider all sensor/filter combinations.  
